2026-11-13 20:22:29,758 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 1. **Data Misclassification**: The "sensitive government documents" recovered are actually publicly available reference materials:
2026-11-13 20:22:29,758 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - OMB Circular A-11 and FEA documentation (publicly published)
